<title>USA: United Dominion says antitrust periods over.</title>
<headline>United Dominion says antitrust periods over.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Dominion Industries Ltd said on Wednesday that the antitrust waiting periods for its tender offer for stock in two companies had expired on July 22.</p>
<p>United Dominion also said it had commenced its tender offer to purchase shares of common stock of the companies, Imo Industries Inc and Core Industries Inc.</p>
<p>United Dominion manufactures engineered products for industrial building markets.</p>
</text>
